flowchart TD
    shared["① shared (service-platform-shared-{env})<br>共通レイヤを公開する<br>/service-platform/{env}/shared/layer-arn を書く"]
    core["② core (service-platform-core-{env})<br>/service-platform/{env}/shared/layer-arn を読む<br>/service-platform/{env}/cognito/*・notify/*・attachments/bucket・ops/topic-arn を書く<br>台帳と監査テーブルもここ"]
    app["③ apps/{app} (service-platform-app-{app}-{env})<br>core のキーと layer-arn を読む<br>/service-platform/{env}/apps/{app}/api-domain を書く"]
    waf["CloudFront 用の WAF (us-east-1)<br>edge より先に作る"]
    edge["④ edge (service-platform-edge-{env})<br>各サービスの api-domain を読む<br>origin-verify の値を注入する"]
    frontend["⑤ frontend<br>/service-platform/{env}/cognito/* の値でビルド<br>S3 へ同期し、CloudFront を無効化する"]
    shared --> core --> app --> edge --> frontend
    waf -.-> edge
    style waf stroke-dasharray: 6 4
